<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 407 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 407 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 407 contracts compared with 389 overnight Wednesday.</p>
<p>There were 48 wheat, 76 corn, 261 soybean, 16 soymeal, two rice and four corn puts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1-3/4 to 2-1/4 cents higher, corn was steady to 1/4 cent higher and soybeans were steady to 1-3/4 cents higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
